=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"vlcsnap 2026 06 11 18h51m11s498.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/6/12/vlcsnap-2026-06-11-18h51m11s498-66.jpg?width=0&amp;s=I_twLcNaiQ-5Se29SsV6XA\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Giờ thì đến lượt các em nhỏ xem phim hoạt hình Labubus trên sân khấu Azteca - Ảnh chụp màn hình</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div>\r\n                                    Thu gọn\r\n                                    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<span>12/06/2026 | 01:05</span>\n</div>\n<h3>\r\n                                        1h\r\n                                    </h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<img src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/v1/icon/down-arrow.svg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"HKjXGoeXsAAcxl7.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images/000001/000003/2026/6/12/hkjxgoexsaacxl7-77.jpg?width=0&amp;s=Q-HGu6ng98VswFFgxUKpUA\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"HKjXZvfWgAEUJeE.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images/000001/000003/2026/6/12/hkjxzvfwgaeujee-78.jpg?width=0&amp;s=zujLoRpXHYXiJ8-2MR3KUw\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Đây là khoảnh khắc mà tất cả chúng ta chờ đợi. Shakira và Bad Burna Boy trình diễn bài hát chính thức của World Cup 'Dai Dai' - Ảnh: FIFA</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"www_thesun_co_uk grab shakira world cup opening 1087650850.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images/000001/000003/2026/6/12/www-thesun-co-uk-grab-shakira-world-cup-opening-1087650850-55.jpg?width=0&amp;s=uEegk74VF9goS4JLf99Lgg\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Shakira lắc lư theo điệu nhạc - Ảnh chụp màn hình</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div>\r\n                                    Thu gọn\r\n                                    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<span>12/06/2026 | 00:52</span>\n</div>\n<h3>\r\n                                        0h45\r\n                                    </h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<img src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/v1/icon/down-arrow.svg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"HKjPW3XXQAAH6cg.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/6/12/hkjpw3xxqaah6cg-37.jpg?width=0&amp;s=0ayJKFCTriB42NViDOIttg\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"HKjPW3XWYAAqi6w.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/6/12/hkjpw3xwyaaqi6w-38.jpg?width=0&amp;s=uf3BFBDNtyn0PHSiseE_Cw\"/></source></picture>\n<figcaption>Lễ khai mạc World Cup 2026 bắt đầu với màn trình diễn đầy sắc màu - Ảnh chụp màn hình</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n<div>\r\n                                    Thu gọn\r\n                                    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n\n<span>12/06/2026 | 00:48</span>\n</div>\n<h3>\r\n                                        0h30\r\n                                    </h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<img src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/v1/icon/down-arrow.svg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><source><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"www_thesun_co_uk image taken instagram 1087155214.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish